 "_about": "Dutch locale example. English loanwords and brand names the Dutch AI voice can mispronounce. scripts/vo/loanwords.py holds every script (lines.json) against this list: each word that appears must be in pronunciation.json, or be replaced in that line's speech text by a spelling of your own. Otherwise gen.py refuses to record. Why: 'websajt' came out as 'websat'; the voice gate doesn't hear pronunciation, whisper writes the word correctly anyway. Words a Dutch speaker says just as they are written (video, logo, route, promo, tips) don't belong here. Another language gets its own reference/lang/<lang>/loanwords.json.",
